| `wall1` | Wall test track |

---



## Output Format

Saved JSON files contain the optimized NURBS parameters:

```json
{
  "control_points": [[x0, y0], [x1, y1], ...],
  "weights": [w0, w1, ...],
  "knot_vector": [u0, u1, ...]
}
```

These can be loaded with `splinepy` to reconstruct the full raceline and evaluate positions, derivatives, and curvature at any parameter value.

